                "text": "James from Austin told me the cost of his health insurance could jump from $142/month to $436/month \u2014 or $839/month if he goes with another policy.\n\n\u201cAs a diabetic, bipolar, and with upcoming hernia surgery, I must have health coverage,\u201d he said. https://t.co/cBFffzcYdG",
