                "text": "John from Kyle: \u201cWe're dropping health insurance entirely. Screw the GOP for sabotaging health care in America.\u201d\n\nHis monthly payment was $1,260 in 2025.\n\nIf Trump and Republicans get their way, he would pay $1,767 a month in 2026. https://t.co/dzoMGSFHZc",
