                "text": "Health care premiums for Patricia\u2019s family in Buda would be $400 higher every month.\n\n\u201cWe have a four year old and I am in school. Not having insurance is scary, but we can't afford it,\u201d she told me. https://t.co/xgRsVxZHls",
